<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns BB+ to South African samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns BB+ to South African samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned a BB+ rating to the Republic of South Africa's 40 billion yen of 3.35 percent samurai bonds due on June 17, 2004.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the outlook is positive.</p>
</text>
